 "name_en": "Customer Returns with Direct Shipment from Customer to Supplier (1Z3)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Customer Returns with Direct Shipment from Customer to Supplier (1Z3)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio4298b61a7a104c90a00dd58d1f3bc2a1\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio4298b61a7a104c90a00dd58d1f3bc2a1__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">The customer contacts the seller and informs the internal sales representative that they want to return products. The sales representative decides that the products must be returned directly to the supplier. This can be the case, for example, when products are initially shipped to the customer via third-party delivery by the supplier.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The sales representative creates a returns order to initiate the return of products to the supplier. Once the returns order is saved and released, a returns purchase order is generated automatically. After the supplier has received the returned products, the seller gets a credit memo from the supplier. The seller compensates the customer with a credit memo or replacement product.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The progress of the customer return processes is monitored by tracking the follow-up documents of returns orders.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio4298b61a7a104c90a00dd58d1f3bc2a1__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create returns order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create returns purchase order (automatically)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform logistical return of products from customer directly to supplier</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform logistical goods receipt at supplier side</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Receive credit memo (seller) from supplier</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Issue credit memo or replacement (seller) to customer</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio4298b61a7a104c90a00dd58d1f3bc2a1__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Enable return of materials from customer directly to supplier</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>含从客户到供应商的直接装运的客户退货 (1Z3)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio4298b61a7a104c90a00dd58d1f3bc2a1\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio4298b61a7a104c90a00dd58d1f3bc2a1__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">客户联系卖方并通知内部销售代表他们想要退回产品。销售代表决定必须将产品直接退回给供应商。例如，当供应商通过第三方交货将产品最初运送给客户时，就会出现这种情况。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">销售代表创建退货订单以发起产品退给供应商。保存并下达退货订单后，将自动生成退货采购订单。供应商收到退货产品后，卖方从供应商处获得贷记凭证。卖方使用贷项凭证或替换产品补偿客户。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">通过跟踪退货订单的后续凭证监控客户退货流程的进度。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio4298b61a7a104c90a00dd58d1f3bc2a1__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建退货订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建退货采购订单（自动）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行产品从客户 直接到供应商 的物流退货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在供应商方执行物流收货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">从供应商处接收贷项凭证（卖方）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">向客户发出贷项凭证或替换（卖方）</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio4298b61a7a104c90a00dd58d1f3bc2a1__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">支持客户将物料直接退回给供应商</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
